/-- MathArena Problem (id=MathArena_hmmt_feb_2026_32, dataset=MathArena_hmmt_feb_2026, idx=32 )
    Informal statement: The numbers 1, 2, ..., 2026 are written on a blackboard. An operation consists of replacing any number on the blackboard with the positive difference between the largest and smallest numbers currently on the blackboard. Determine, with proof, the least number of operations required to make all the numbers on the blackboard equal.
    Answer: 3037
